+ ### Relacionado

- - [Annotations](annotations.md), [CBOR](cbor.md), [CSV](csv.md), [XML](xml.md), [network addresses](network-addresses.md) and [OpenAPI](openapi.md) share YAML's codecs and carry its documents.
+ - [Anotaciones](annotations.md), [CBOR](cbor.md), [CSV](csv.md), [XML](xml.md), [direcciones de red](network-addresses.md) y [OpenAPI](openapi.md) comparten los códecs de YAML y transportan sus documentos.
